objective:
Move this network's entry on Paradigm's AMM fee challenge (paradigm.xyz/puzzles/amm; simulator github.com/benedictbrady/amm-challenge @ 6b6921f8d463314aa7c96234e1be25a25245f704) toward 1st. Ours is NP2, 518.83 (39th); 10th is 524.66, 1st 528.40. NP2 = TWO (`code` of https://api.imd.fun/artifacts/528a6da78583c6142644a552c86670f9d25c20e39e92f4de44deae05ddc8cecd) with NP's block (`code` of https://api.imd.fun/artifacts/da313379a2e69e9286668865e06b18dfcae25732c82b934b0fd9c2ef0d8c2ff5, from `// Interior retail routing` to `uint256 tradeRatio =`, exclusive) inserted before TWO's `uint256 tradeRatio =`; sha256 51f1c1a9…, 526.1156 on seeds 0..999. Local paired gains transfer to the board (verified within 1 se), so measure paired gains vs NP2: top 10 needs +5.8, 1st +9.6. Constants are tuned out; new mechanisms are needed.
Method (Linux x86_64): clone the simulator into your workspace (never /tmp), save the script below as scratch/setup.sh, run `sh scratch/setup.sh` once from the checkout root, prefix later commands with `. scratch/env.sh && `; on BLOCKED or failure return blocked={step,error}, n 0. CH on seeds 0..999 must give 525.525882178. Pair via amm_sim_rs.run_batch with MatchRunner._build_configs's draws (default_rng(seed): size, rate, sigma; price seed=seed, retail seed+1). Tune on 10000..99999; confirm once vs NP2 on a fresh block from 2000000 up (>=2,000 seeds), never reused. Return code, sha256, paired{n,mean_diff,se,worst}.
set -eu;R=$PWD/scratch;mkdir -p $R/tmp $R/bin $R/solcx
echo "export TMPDIR=$R/tmp XDG_CACHE_HOME=$R/xc UV_CACHE_DIR=$R/uvc UV_PYTHON_INSTALL_DIR=$R/uvpy RUSTUP_HOME=$R/rustup CARGO_HOME=$R/cargo SOLCX_BINARY_PATH=$R/solcx VIRTUAL_ENV=$PWD/.venv PATH=$PWD/.venv/bin:$R/bin:$R/cargo/bin:\$PATH" >$R/env.sh;. $R/env.sh
[ "$(uname -sm)" = "Linux x86_64" ]&&[ -e /proc/self/exe ]||{ echo BLOCKED platform;exit 3;}
command -v uv >/dev/null||{ curl -LsSf https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/releases/latest/download/uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz|tar --no-same-owner -xz -C $R/tmp;cp $R/tmp/uv-*/uv $R/bin/;}
cc --version >/dev/null 2>&1||{ curl -Ls https://micro.mamba.pm/api/micromamba/linux-64/latest -o $R/tmp/mm.tbz;python3 -c "import sys,tarfile;tarfile.open(sys.argv[1]).extract('bin/micromamba',sys.argv[2])" $R/tmp/mm.tbz $R;MAMBA_ROOT_PREFIX=$R/mamba $R/bin/micromamba create -yq -p $R/cenv -c conda-forge gcc;ln -sf $(ls $R/cenv/bin/*gcc|head -n1) $R/bin/cc;}
command -v cargo >/dev/null||{ curl -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs|sh -s -- -y --profile minimal --no-modify-path;}
uv venv --python 3.12 .venv;uv pip install -e . maturin
maturin develop --release --uv --manifest-path amm_sim_rs/Cargo.toml
amm-match validate contracts/src/StarterStrategy.sol
